        171.77,
        528.96,
        202.92,
        116.62,
        202.92
      ],
      "text": "The undersigned is directed to say that with effect from the\n19th September, 1995 -"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 7,
      "poly": [
        151.72,
        212.18,
        530.74,
        212.18,
        530.74,
        290.49,
        151.72,
        290.49
      ],
      "text": "(i) Shri Eduardo Faleiro, Minister of State in the Ministry\nof Chemicals and Fertilisers, Minister of State in the\nMinistry of Parliamentary Affairs and Minister of State\nin the Departments of Electronics and Ocean\nDevelopment, relinquished the additional charge of the\noffice of the Minister of State in the Ministry of\nParliamentary Affairs."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 8,
      "poly": [
        146.97,
        291.33,
        533.12,
        291.33,
        533.12,
        358.69,
        146.97,
        358.69
      ],
      "text": "(ii) Smt. Krishna Sahi relinquished the office of the\nMinister of State in the Ministry of Civil Supplies,\nConsumer Affairs and Public Distribution and assumed\nthe office of the Minister of State in the Ministry of\nCivil Supplies, Consumer Affairs and Public\nDistribution (Department of Civil Supplies)."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 9,
      "poly": [
        142.2,
        361.22,
        536.69,
        361.22,
        536.69,
        479.1,
        142.2,
        479.1
      ],
      "text": "(iii) Shri Mallikarjun, Minister of State in the Ministry of\nDefence, Minister of State in the Ministry of\nParliamentary Affairs and Minister of State in the\nMinistry of Railways, relinquished the office of the\nMinister of State in the Ministry of Defence and the\nadditional charge of the office of the Minister of\nState in the Ministry of Railways and assumed the\noffice of the Minister of State in the Ministry of\nDefence (Department of Defence). He will continue to\nhold the charge of the office of the Minister of State\nin the Ministry of Parliamentary Affairs."
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 10,
      "poly": [
        152.32,
        479.94,
        537.88,
        479.94,
        537.88,
        538.04,
        152.32,
        538.04
      ],
      "text": "(iv) Shri S.S. Ahluwalia, Minister of State in the Ministry\nof Urban Affairs and Employment (Department of Urban\nEmployment and Poverty Alleviation), assumed the charge\nof the office, also, of the Minister of State in the\nMinistry of Parliamentary Affairs."
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 11,
      "poly": [
        160.65,
        538.04,
        540.86,
        538.04,
        540.86,
        615.5,
        160.65,
        615.5
      ],
      "text": "(v) Shri Venod Sharma relinquished the office of the\nMinister of State in the Ministry of Civil Supplies,\nConsumer Affairs and Public Distribution and assumed\nthe office of the Minister of State in the Ministry of\nCivil Supplies, Consumer Affairs and Public\nDistribution (Department of Consumer Affairs and Public\nDistribution System)."
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "text",
